==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has reached a massive 111,111,111 downloads worldwide! In thanks to all of our players, we've got special events available for a limited time!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 11th (11:00am) until June 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited DL Celebration Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Use Legendary Starshines to access the special Event Capsules!<br>
Featuring a rush of limited units and Featured Items!<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Featured Item(s): Platinum Shard (up to 10)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Reward(s): 3 Limited Units, XP, Battle Items'''}}<br>
Collect all 10 Platinum Shard to get a {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Platinum Ticket'''}} and guarantee an Uber Rare unit!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> The Event Capsules can only be used with Event Tickets earned in-game.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends and Event Tickets will be unusable.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Extra Event Tickets cannot be converted into items or XP.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Featured items will no longer appear in the Capsules once they have all been collected.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・ Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Half-off level-up and evolution costs for all Cats!'''}}<br>
Give your Cats a quick boost while you can!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 21st (11:00am) until June 1st (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 111M DL Celebration Stamps now available!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Up to 19 111,111,111 DL Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Rewards: 5 Rare Tickets, 5 Cat Tickets, Battle Items<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''111,111,111 DL Celebration Missions'''}}<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, XP, Battle Items<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Limited-time Special Missions will only be available until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the Missions disappear at the end of the event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Download Celebration Stages on now!'''}}<br>
Earn Cat Tickets, XP, and items by clearing the Download Celebration Stages! Visit the Legend Stages from the title screen to access these limited-time stages!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・111M Celebration Gifts Galore! on now!'''}}<br>
The Battle Cats has hit 111,111,111 downloads and a new stage is available to celebrate, with a {{Color|#34A853|'''20 Cat Food reward'''}} for clearing it!<br>
Once this stage is cleared, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''it will be reset at 12AM the next day and can be cleared again for another 20 Cat Food reward!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage every day during the event to {{Color|#FF0000|'''earn up to 380 Cat Food'''}}!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・111M DL Celebration event on now!'''}}<br>
When The Battle Cats hits 111,111,111 downloads, that means one thing - time to party with a spectacular festival!<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#FF9900|'''Legendary Starshine'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Using a Catamin A will immediately grant you another stage attempt.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Map: "Fireworks Spectacular"'''}}<br>
The Fireworks Gang gets ready to blast off in a tough new map!<br>
Reward(s): Catseye (Legend, Dark), Rare Ticket, etc.<br>
※ This stage can be challenged at User Rank 1600 or higher.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Legend Stages/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings'''}}{{Color|#4285F4|''','''}} and {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Island of Ash!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check the Event Calendar for event availability.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Catseye Cave and XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Catseye rewards!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest (4 areas)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 11th (11:00am) until May 21st (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Catseye Cave'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 21st (11:00am) until June 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Catseye Limited Capsules & Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 11th (11:00am) until May 21st (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from May 21st (11:00am) until June 1st (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Catseye Item Capsules drop Catseyes and XP.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Catfruit Item Capsules drop Catfruit, XP, and other items.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Catseye Item Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules after reaching User Rank 1600.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Catfruit Item Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3.

